      "Ranking runs in stages: cheap retrieval and lightweight models shrink thousands of candidates, then heavier neural models predict actions such as like, comment, share or hide and combine them into a relevance score.",
      "Integrity systems apply policy classifiers and enforcement signals, removing violating content and demoting borderline or low-quality posts before anything reaches the screen.",
      "In parallel, the ads system retrieves eligible ads and runs an auction; Meta publicly describes the winner as the ad with the highest total value, combining advertiser bid, estimated action rate and ad quality.",
      "A blender interleaves organic posts and winning ads into slots, applies diversity and frequency rules, and returns the page to the client.",
      "Impressions, clicks, dwell and hides are logged to streaming pipelines, which refresh features and feed retraining so ranking and ads models stay current.",
