    "title": "Stock trading & order matching engine",
    "summary": "Takes orders from a broker app through margin and risk checks into a per-symbol order book that matches by strict price-time priority, then publishes confirmations, market data and settlement files. It must never break ordering or fairness, lose an acknowledged order or trade, or let an order through without the margin to cover it.",
