      "Each resume is put on a queue as its own job keyed by (job_id, resume_hash), so retries are idempotent and one bad file never blocks a batch.",
      "A worker calls an agent built with create_agent, passing a system prompt with extraction rules, a JD lookup tool that returns must-have and nice-to-have requirements, and response_format set to a Pydantic ResumeProfile schema.",
      "PIIMiddleware runs before the model sees input, redacting emails and replacing phone numbers through a custom regex detector; redaction counts, not values, are written to the audit store.",
