      "The deep agent, built with create_deep_agent, loads saved preferences from the LangGraph store and uses write_todos to break the question into sub-questions and a report outline.",
      "For each sub-question it calls the task tool to spawn a search subagent with its own clean context, which runs web searches through a tool adapted from an MCP server with MultiServerMCPClient.",
      "The subagent fetches the most relevant pages, converts HTML to text, and writes short notes with quotes, URLs and access dates to files in the virtual filesystem, returning only a brief summary to the main agent.",
      "As the run grows, summarization (pre-assembled by Deep Agents) compresses older messages while full notes stay in files, so the main context holds plans and summaries, not raw pages.",
