      "A prompt plus model component classifies the ticket into a fixed category list (billing, outage, bug, how-to, account access) and returns a confidence score, with unknown allowed as an answer.",
      "A second model call extracts structured fields such as order id, product, error message and stated urgency into a fixed JSON schema; a custom component validates formats and drops anything that fails.",
