      "Only after the guest explicitly confirms the read-back details does the agent call the Create booking tool, which writes to the reservations system with an idempotency key and returns a booking reference or an error.",
      "The Chat Output component returns the reply (booking reference, alternatives or a follow-up question) to the backend, which shows it to the guest.",
      "Every run is traced to Langfuse or LangSmith with the session id, so failed bookings, tool errors and odd answers can be reviewed per conversation."
