      "Commit the component to a version-controlled folder that every Langflow instance loads at startup through its custom components path. It then shows up in the components sidebar for every builder.",
      "Drag the component into a test flow and run it in the Playground. Check the outputs, the error messages and how inputs render on the canvas.",
      "At run time the output method builds the request, calls the company API with a timeout and bounded retries, and returns structured Data or a Message. A clear error is raised instead of an empty result.",
